{"id":142747471428408,"type":"artist","name":"Ty Segall","artist":null,"year":1987,"weight":36,"info":{"bio":"Ty Segall (8 de Junio 1987) es un músico y compositor americano. Canta, toca la batería y la guitarra. Ha lanzado ocho álbumes en solitario y es miembro de las bandas Fuzz, The Traditional Fools, Epsilons, Party Fowl, Sic Alps, The Perverts, y Ty Segall Band.\n\n . User-contributed text is available under the Creative Commons By-SA License; additional terms may apply.","tags":["Garage Rock","Lo-Fi","Garage Punk","garage","noise"],"country":"US","origin":"United States","begin":"1987-06-08","kind":"Person","aliases":"Ty Segall Band,Ty Segall & White Fence,Thee Oh Sees,Fuzz,Meatbodies","member_of":"Garage Rock,Lo-Fi,seen live,Garage Punk,garage","similar":["Ty Segall Band","Ty Segall & White Fence","Thee Oh Sees","Fuzz","Meatbodies","Frankie and the Witch Fingers","Wand","Osees","White Fence","Mikal Cronin"],"wikipedia":"Ty Garrett Segall (Laguna Beach, California, 8 de junio de 1987) es un músico de rock originario de Laguna Beach, California, es conocido debido a sus potentes composiciones y actuaciones en directo; ha formado parte de las agrupaciones Fuzz, Broken Bat and GØGGS, The Traditional Fools, Epsilons, Party Fowl, Sic Alps, The Perverts y actualmente esta con el grupo formado por el mismo Ty Segall Band.\n\nConsolidado parte del nuevo movimiento del garage rock actual, junto con grupos como Wavves, Thee Oh Sees, The Black Angels, Coachwips, FIDLAR, Rain, entre otros.\n\nLas influencias del cantante es variada, pero las más importantes del cantante son: GG Allin, The Stooges, Hawkwind, Marc Bolan, David Bowie, Neil Young, The Beatles, West Coast Pop Art Experimental Band, The Byrds, T. Rex, Grateful Dead, Black Sabbath, Kiss y Black Flag.\n\nLos grupos Twin Peaks y Carisma mayormente están influenciados por Ty Segall.\n\nFestejando el Cassette Week 2021, el sello argentino Fichines Ruido Zafarla lanzó una edición en cassette de GØGGS llamada “En vivo en Teragram Ballroom”.[1]​","disambiguation":"US garage rock musician","links":{"spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/58XGUNsRNu3cVOIOYk5chx","discogs":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/1265284","bandcamp":"https://tysegall.bandcamp.com","wikipedia":"https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ty_Segall","lastfm":"https://www.last.fm/music/Ty+Segall","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/07a17571-81fc-4cf8-a634-98f0d926d313","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/ty-segall-official"},"img":null},"works":[{"id":231027654378234,"type":"album","name":"Horn the Unicorn","artist":"Ty Segall","year":2007,"weight":7,"yt":"ZPKhBX0BnEQ","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":92833932348949,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Surf Punk","rank":23,"scaruffi":null},{"id":167213801476273,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Surf Music","rank":199,"scaruffi":null},{"id":182534437492895,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Indie Surf","rank":109,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":259215513966256,"type":"album","name":"Ty Segall","artist":"Ty Segall","year":2008,"weight":7,"yt":"qwHcVxW35jY","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":142489294796000,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Punk Blues","rank":95,"scaruffi":null},{"id":197206636223287,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Shitgaze","rank":18,"scaruffi":null},{"id":231664946546858,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Garage Psych","rank":151,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":116233949504474,"type":"album","name":"Swag / Sitting in the Back of a Morris Marina Parked at the Pier Eating Sandwiches Whilst the Rain Drums on the Roof","artist":"Ty Segall /","year":2009,"weight":7,"yt":"7HPAJgaxhSc","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":92833932348949,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Surf Punk","rank":24,"scaruffi":null},{"id":182534437492895,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Indie Surf","rank":115,"scaruffi":null},{"id":197206636223287,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Shitgaze","rank":38,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":34374698515093,"type"